# Core project rules

- Before changing tests, pages, or API clients, read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/PROGRESS.md`, and `docs/PROJECT-RULES.md`.
- After meaningful work, update `docs/PROGRESS.md`.
- Write code, comments, and docs in English.
- Never commit `.env`, `.env.*` (except `.env.example`), tokens, or real passwords.
- Do not hardcode URLs, users, or test data in specs. Use `testdata/*.json` via `src/config/env.ts` / `testdata.ts`.

```typescript
// BAD
const token = 'eyJhbGciOi...';
await page.goto('https://appsandbox.kliqapp.io/login');

// GOOD
const { brandEmail, brandPassword } = requireApiEnv();
```
